   "verb": "akeru",
   "verbJa": "開ける",
   "verbSense": "open something (a door, a box, your eyes)",
   "englishVerb": "open",
   "trap": "English 'open' does both jobs. Someone opening it is akeru (doa akete); the door opening or being open is aku (doa aiteru).",
   "partners": [
    "mado (window)",
