   "verbJa": "閉める",
   "verbSense": "shut something (a door, a window, a lid); with kagi, lock",
   "englishVerb": "close",
   "trap": "Not tojiru: dictionaries give it for 'close', but tojiru is for eyes, books and apps. Doors, windows and lids are shimeru.",
   "partners": [
    "mado (window)",
