    "futa (lid)",
    "kagi (lock: lock up)"
   ],
   "flags": [],
   "use": "Mostly a request or reminder: doa shimete (shut the door), chanto shimete ne. Casual speech drops o; a door that is shut is doa shimatteru.",
   "notes": "With kagi the same verb means lock: kagi shimeta? = did you lock up?",
   "example": {
